  {
    "sha": "e69a871bf6b22890af361c2c02e32609fdde82e7",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVoU8JdoAKGU2OWE4NzFiZjZiMjI4OTBhZjM2MWMyYzAyZTMyNjA5ZmRkZTgyZTc",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Mike Kinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-20T09:54:30Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Mike Kinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-20T09:54:30Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): Display menu quality preset, ground shadow, ambient occlusion and Look at a work plane\n\nStacked on #2835 (the Display menu of #2818).\n\n- Graphics group: the presets \"Performance\" and \"Quality\" and the\n  switches \"Ground shadow\" and \"Ambient occlusion\". A preset sets the two\n  switches; the active preset is derived from them, so a switch changed\n  by hand leaves no preset active. View state, saved in view.json; an old\n  file loads the switches off.\n- Ground shadow: the model bodies projected straight down on the floor,\n  sampled on a grid, blurred, drawn as blended triangles (ground_shadow,\n  Pipe::GroundShadow).\n- Ambient occlusion: one baked value for each model vertex, from short\n  rays through a surface voxel grid (occlusion), drawn by the face shader\n  through a second vertex buffer (Pipe::FacesOccluded).\n- shade_cache: the shadow keys on the facets, the shown pose and the\n  floor; the occlusion keys on the facets of one body. A still frame and\n  a switch that is off build nothing (counter tests).\n- Look at a work plane: one click on an origin axis turns the view to\n  the plane of that axis; the origin point gives the XY plane.\n- world_verts moved out of egui_app/world.rs (400-line law).\n\nFixes #2834\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
